    "first_call": "Still hashes files. All first-call observations, including the 155.942 ms baseline outlier, are retained. Filesystem caches were not flushed.",
    "claim": "Repeated Cache::open preparation only, not installed attachment time, video latency, FPS or physical device acceptance."
